{"id":"046b7bab77e9f0c3","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-tcl-nl.md","title":"FO(TC)=NL定理","display":"thm-tcl-nl — FO(TC)=NL定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-tcl-nl","aliases":["29-thm-tcl-nl"],"display":"thm-tcl-nl — FO(TC)=NL定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-tc]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 9.10; Corollary 9.22, pp.143,150, DjVu scans 158,165","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-tcl-nl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-tcl-nl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tcl-nl — FO(TC)=NL定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 9.10; Corollary 9.22, pp.143,150, DjVu scans 158,165"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；所有查询限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO(TC)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO(TC)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(TC)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(TC)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正 TC 上界见原书 Theorem 9.10；任意 TC 的否定闭包由 §9.3–9.5 的正规形与补集论证取得。本次核对陈述和证明结构，未逐式重验闭包模拟。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"re